    "ko": "소공녀는 파혼을 기다린다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After being separated from her mother, Savina is forced to live with her uncle and the Charlots, who despise her. To make things worse, due to the memories of her past life, Savina learns she'll be killed by Prince Ricardo if she remains in her new home. But before she can convince her uncle to send her somewhere else, she discovers that Ricardo will be coming to stay with the Charlots. With this turn of events, will Savina successfully change her future? Or does fate have other plans for her?"
  },
